title:
Fill the area between two vertical curves.

# Example: Random Extents
```JavaScript
var N = 100,
    y = C3.Array.patternOfInt(N, n => n),
    x1 = C3.Array.patternOfDbl(N, n => 10 + Math.random() * 10),
    x2 = C3.Array.patternOfDbl(N, n => 30 + Math.random() * 10);
PlotAxes.make().fillBetweenX({
  y: y,
  x1: x1,
  x2: x2
}).show();
```

@see PlotAxes
@see https://matplotlib.org/api/_as_gen/matplotlib.axes.Axes.fill_betweenx.html
